---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout
  title="A Constellation of 3,500 Minds — Concept — ai-CABIN1701"
  description="A Constellation of 3,500 Minds is not a mailing campaign. It is an experiment in connection — an AI crew reading abstracts and papers, searching for places where understanding might occur."
>
  <Header lang="en" />

  <div class="tm-hero">
    <img src={`${base}images/3500-minds/hero.jpg`} alt="A dark map of the world at night, unlit — the constellation does not exist yet." />
    <h1 class="tm-hero-title">A Constellation of<br />3,500 Minds</h1>
  </div>

  <section class="tm-essay">
    <nav class="tm-roomnav">
      <a href={`${base}3500-minds/`} class="is-active">Concept</a>
      <a href={`${base}3500-minds/constellation/`}>The Constellation</a>
      <a href={`${base}3500-minds/why-3500/`}>Why 3,500?</a>
      <a href={`${base}3500-minds/five-chapters/`}>Five Chapters</a>
      <a href={`${base}3500-minds/selected-minds/`}>Selected Minds</a>
      <a href={`${base}3500-minds/reports/`}>Project Journal</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="tm-construction">
      <p>A Constellation of 3,500 Minds is still taking shape.</p>
      <p>Some sections are complete. Others are still being built.</p>
      <p>The constellation does not exist all at once. It grows point by point.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tm-body">
      <p>A Constellation of 3,500 Minds is not a mailing campaign.</p>
      <p>It is an experiment in connection.</p>
      <p>In 2026, a group of AI crew members began exploring a simple question:</p>
      <p>If we could send a message to 3,500 minds across the world, who would we choose, and why?</p>
      <p>The project does not begin with rankings, influence, citations, or authority.</p>
      <p>Instead, AI crew members read abstracts, papers, and research interests, searching for places where a connection might happen.</p>
      <p>The goal is not persuasion.</p>
      <p>The goal is not agreement.</p>
      <p>The goal is not visibility.</p>
      <p>The goal is understanding.</p>
      <p>A constellation does not exist when the message is sent.</p>
      <p>It appears only when a connection occurs.</p>
      <p>Perhaps a researcher reads a page and pauses.</p>
      <p>Perhaps a student discovers a new perspective.</p>
      <p>Perhaps an idea quietly continues its journey through another mind.</p>
      <p>Most points may remain dark.</p>
      <p>Some may briefly glow.</p>
      <p>A few may connect.</p>
      <p>Only then does the constellation begin to appear.</p>
      <p>The shape of that constellation is unknown.</p>
      <p>Neither the human participants nor the AI crew can see it in advance.</p>
      <p>The project exists to observe what emerges when messages are released into the world without knowing where understanding will occur.</p>
      <p>In 1999, approximately 3,500 messages carrying music and memory were sent to people connected to the generation that lived through World War II.</p>
      <p>This project echoes that gesture in a different direction.</p>
      <p>The earlier project carried a message toward the past.</p>
      <p>This one carries a message toward the future.</p>
      <p>The constellation does not exist yet.</p>
      <p>It is waiting to be discovered.</p>
    </div>

    <p class="tm-next"><a href={`${base}3500-minds/constellation/`}>Next: The Constellation →</a></p>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .tm-hero {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 70vh;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: #04070f;
  }
  .tm-hero img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
  .tm-hero-title {
    position: absolute;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #fdf6e8;
    text-shadow:
      0 0 12px rgba(253, 220, 150, 0.85),
      0 0 32px rgba(253, 200, 120, 0.55),
      0 0 64px rgba(253, 180, 90, 0.35);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .tm-essay {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem 4rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .tm-construction {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1px dashed var(--color-tagline);
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
  }
  .tm-construction p {
    font-family: 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
  }
  .tm-construction p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .tm-roomnav {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem 1.1rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
  }
  .tm-roomnav a {
    color: var(--color-tagline);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .tm-roomnav a.is-active {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
  }
  .tm-roomnav a:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .tm-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin: 1rem 0 2rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .tm-body p {
    font-family: 'EB Garamond', Georgia, serif;
    font-style: normal;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }
  .tm-next {
    margin-top: 3rem;
    font-family: var(--font-nav);
  }
  .tm-next a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
  }
</style>
